# The build context is this directory, and it holds the build's own output.
# Without this, every rebuild uploads the previous 295 MB rootfs.tar to the
# container runtime before doing anything - slow, and for nothing.
#
# Named .dockerignore rather than .containerignore because BOTH podman and docker
# read this name, and build.sh supports either - one file, nothing to keep in
# step.
rootfs.tar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
